{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41154","headline":"和武相公中秋夜西蜀锦楼望月得清字 · 王良会","name":"和武相公中秋夜西蜀锦楼望月得清字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"德星摇此夜，珥月满重城。\n杳霭烟氛色，飘颻砧杵声。\n令行秋气爽，乐感素风轻。\n共赏千年圣，长歌四海清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王良会","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}